cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Skyline-Aided UAV Navigation"
abstract: >-
  Research implementation accompanying the master's thesis "Stitching Based UAV
  Optical Navigation With Skyline-based Localization": stitching-based visual
  odometry with metric scale and heading from external channels, skyline-profile
  place recognition, conservative translation-only relocalization, and the
  evaluation tooling used in the thesis.
authors:
  - given-names: Adi
    family-names: Passover
repository-code: "https://github.com/AdiPassover/skyline-aided-uav-navigation"
keywords:
  - UAV navigation
  - visual odometry
  - skyline
  - relocalization
  - GNSS-denied navigation
